From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Brian Jenkins <brianjenkins94@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 17 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] refactor: split extension-host contribution per feature

Move the chat / language-model / AI / speech, notebook, and mcp mainThread
bridges out of the always-on extensionHost.contribution and into per-feature
files, so they are only registered when the corresponding service override is
installed. Mirrors the existing per-feature contribution splits (0037, 0073).

---
diff --git a/src/vs/workbench/api/browser/extensionHost.chat.contribution.ts b/src/vs/workbench/api/browser/extensionHost.chat.contribution.ts
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..6404ac8
--- /dev/null
+++ b/src/vs/workbench/api/browser/extensionHost.chat.contribution.ts
@@ -0,0 +1,22 @@
